        "created_at": "2015-11-26T13:59:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Take Citizen Dawn, if Infrared Eyepiece reveals 2 Citizens that wouldn't be bad to have in play, you can put the other one back on top on The Sentinel's turn. Next round will The Wraith uses Infrared Eyepiece, you know you will not reveal dual Devastating Auroras. If you place Devastating Aurora, Return with the Dawn, or Channel the Exclipse on bottom, Writhe can discard it.&nbsp;</p><p>At least this is what I think Pydro is talking about it.</p><p>Edit: Darn, took too long to respond.</p>",
