        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/779978/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-11-27T20:48:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not saying that the power doesn't have some use, just that I have hard time seeing it as being worth the opportunity cost.</p>",
