      {
        "id": 114747,
        "name": "Dandolo",
        "username": "Dandolo",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-12-29T17:09:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Something which I believe is easy to miss…<br>\nHypocratic Oath does not require that the target selected to take damage by Medico be the target that regains HP… it is a smart move to target another Sentinel (to take advantage of Nemesis bonus) even if you plan on healing another hero… better yet target Chrono-Ranger with Hunter and Hunted in play or TermiNation Absolute Zero.</p>",
