      {
        "id": 114749,
        "name": "Dandolo",
        "username": "Dandolo",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-12-29T17:52:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Which also means that damage to Villains can become healing for heroes, which is relevant if you want to turn Blackout into one of the best healing effects in the game.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Never thought of that one… sounds like a great way to deal with The Matriarch.</p>\n<p>I did just play a game where I used Fling into Darkness to destroy a full health manifestation and heal a hero by 3.</p>\n<p>So many fun Sentinels combos!</p>",
